## API Endpoints Reference

### 1. GET `/api/college/get_eligible_not_applied/:jobId`

Get students who meet eligibility criteria for a job but haven't applied (also excludes students who denied).

**Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer <token>`

**Query Parameters:**

| Param | Type | Default | Description |
|-------|------|---------|-------------|
| `search` | string | — | Search by student name or email |
| `dept_name` | string | — | Filter by department name (partial match) |
| `sort_by` | `overall_cgpa` / `student_name` / `student_email` / `dept_name` | `overall_cgpa` | Sort column |
| `sort_order` | `asc` / `desc` | `desc` | Sort direction |
| `page` | number | 1 | Page number |
| `limit` | number | 10 | Records per page (max 100) |

**Example:** `GET /api/college/get_eligible_not_applied/abc123?dept_name=Computer&page=1&limit=20`

**Success Response (200):**
