### 2. POST `/api/college/notify_eligible_students/:jobId`

Send notifications to eligible students who haven't applied. Skips duplicate notifications.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
    "title": "Reminder: TCS Application Deadline Approaching",
    "body": "You are eligible for the Software Developer position at TCS. Application deadline is April 15, 2025. Don't miss this opportunity!",
    "student_ids": []
}
```

> **Note:** If `student_ids` is empty (`[]`) or omitted, ALL eligible-not-applied students are notified. If provided, only those specific students (intersection with eligible-not-applied set) are notified.

**Success Response (201):**
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Notification sent successfully",
    "data": {
        "notified_count": 42,
        "skipped_count": 3,
        "job": {
            "job_id": "...",
            "job_title": "Software Developer",
            "company_name": "TCS"
        }
    }
}
```

> `skipped_count` = students who already received a deadline reminder notification for this job.

**Error Responses:**
| Status | Condition |
|--------|-----------|
| 404 | Job not found |
| 400 | Validation failure |

