### 3. GET `/api/college/get_job_denials/:jobId`

Get students who explicitly denied/opted out of a job.

**Query Parameters:**

| Param | Type | Default | Description |
|-------|------|---------|-------------|
| `search` | string | — | Search by name, email, or denial reason |
| `sort_by` | `denied_at` / `student_name` / `denial_reason` | `denied_at` | Sort column |
| `sort_order` | `asc` / `desc` | `desc` | Sort direction |
| `page` | number | 1 | Page number |
| `limit` | number | 10 | Records per page (max 100) |

**Example:** `GET /api/college/get_job_denials/abc123?search=rahul&page=1`

**Success Response (200):**
