## Edge Case Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | Expected Result |
|---|----------|----------------|
| 1 | Job with no eligibility criteria set | Returns ALL active students of that passout_year who haven't applied (no criteria filters applied) |
| 2 | Job where all eligible students applied | Returns empty `students` array with `eligible_not_applied_count: 0` |
| 3 | Non-existent jobId | `404` — "Job posting not found" |
| 4 | Job from another college | `404` — college isolation |
| 5 | Notify with empty `student_ids` array | Notifies ALL eligible-not-applied students |
| 6 | Notify with specific `student_ids` | Only notifies students that are in the eligible-not-applied set |
| 7 | Notify same students twice | Second call: `skipped_count` equals number already notified, `notified_count: 0` |
| 8 | Notify with non-eligible student IDs | Those IDs are silently skipped (not in eligible set) |
| 9 | Job with denials but no denials data | Returns empty `denials` array with `total: 0` |
| 10 | Student who applied AND denied (shouldn't happen) | Excluded from eligible-not-applied; appears in denials only |
| 11 | Student with active restriction | Excluded from eligible-not-applied (filtered out by restriction check) |

