## Integration with Existing & Future APIs

### How It Connects

```
Job Postings (job.service.js)
    ↓ job_id
Eligibility Criteria (jobCriteria.service.js)
    ↓ criteria + passout_year
Eligible Not Applied (this module)
    ↓ computes: eligible students − applied students − denied students
    ↓ can trigger: notifications → notifications table
    
Application Denials (application_denials table)
    ↓ populated by Student API (future: student deny endpoint)
    ↓ read by: getJobDenials (this module)
```

| Related Module | Relationship |
|---------------|-------------|
| **Job Eligibility Criteria** | Reuses same eligibility WHERE logic to compute eligible student set |
| **Student Applications** | `NOT EXISTS` filter excludes students who already applied |
| **Application Denials** | Read-only — shows students who opted out |
| **Notifications** | Inserts `deadline_reminder` notifications for eligible students |
| **Student Restrictions** | Restricted students are excluded from eligible set |

### Future Integration

| Future Module | How It Integrates |
|--------------|-------------------|
| **Student Job Browse & Apply** | Student deny endpoint will INSERT into `application_denials` |
| **Student Notifications** | Students see the deadline reminders in their notification feed |
| **Dashboard / Analytics** | Show eligible-not-applied counts per job for conversion analytics |

